      "writtenOn": "2018-02-14T23:34:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This can be a large allocation which means kmalloc is not appropriate, since kmalloc requires physically contiguous \"low\" memory and is also limited to KMALLOC_MAX_SIZE.  kvzalloc() and kvfree() would be better on kernels which have them, and vzalloc() and vfree() on older kernels that don\u0027t.",
